{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.photon_threading_mass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.photon_threading_mass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.photon_threading_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.photon_threading_mass","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L68-L76","doc":"**Mass as photon-threading cost** ([`prop:photon-threading-mass`]).\n\n`m_𝔋 = (q − 1)² · |q − q⁻¹| · Σ_w |c_w|`, *derived* by substituting\nthe crossing-energy definition into mass–energy equivalence. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:photon-threading-mass","label":"prop:photon-threading-mass","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/photon-threading-mass.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.mass_energy_equiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.mass_energy_equiv","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L66-L66","doc":"**Mass–energy equivalence (input 2):** the crossing energy converts\nto mass through the factor `(q − 1)² = 1/c_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.crossing_energy_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.crossing_energy_eq","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L62-L62","doc":"**Crossing-energy definition (input 1):** each of the `n_steps`\nHecke reductions costs `|q − q⁻¹|` in Skein units, weighted by the\ncoefficient `|c_w|`, so `E_𝔋 = |q − q⁻¹| · Σ_w |c_w|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.n_steps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.n_steps","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Number of Hecke reduction steps required for photon threading. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.c_w_abs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.c_w_abs","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The Hecke-reduction step coefficients `|c_w|` indexed by step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.E_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.E_H","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Crossing energy `E_𝔋` of the hadron braid (Skein units). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.m_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.m_H","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Categorical mass `m_𝔋` of the hadron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.q","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PhotonThreadingMassContext","kind":"class","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/photon_threading_mass.lean#L42-L66","doc":"Inputs for the photon-threading mass identity.\n\nThe two manuscript facts that *compose* into the mass equation are\ncarried as explicit fields (§3b-cond): the definition of the\ncrossing energy as the summed Hecke cost, and mass–energy\nequivalence. The headline equation is derived from them. ","signatureChunk":0}]}